LUTAR-1#1 Warning
LUT drives async reset alert  
LUT cell rst_ff[3]_i_1, with 2 or more inputs, drives asynchronous preset/clear pin(s) rst_ff_reg[0]/PRE, rst_ff_reg[1]/PRE, rst_ff_reg[2]/PRE, rst_ff_reg[3]/PRE. The LUT may glitch and trigger an unexpected reset, even if it is a properly timed path.
